TI  - The RoadMAP Relapse Prevention Group Counseling Toolkit™: counselor adherence and competence outcomes.
JF  - Journal of Substance Abuse Treatment
AU  - Brooks Adam C
AU  - Carpenedo Carolyn M
AU  - Fairfax-Columbo Jaymes
AU  - Clements Nicolle T
AU  - Benishek Lois A
