TY  - JOUR
TI  - Do patient characteristics and initial progress in treatment moderate the effectiveness of telephone-based continuing care for substance use disorders?
JF  - Addiction
AU  - McKay JR
AU  - Lynch KG
AU  - Shepard DS
AU  - Morgenstern J
AU  - Forman RF
AU  - Pettinati HM
KW  - eppi-reviewer
KW  - After Care -- Methods
